    <string name="sbp_help_title">Six-Ball Puzzle</string>
    <string name="sbp_help_text">Tilt the tray with the four arrow buttons or by swiping the board. Every ball rolls as far as it can until a post, the rail or another ball stops it. Put each ball on the slot with its own symbol and colour. Finish in par tilts or fewer for three stars. Undo is unlimited, and Hint shows the next tilt of a shortest solution.</string>
