    <string name="pig_help_title">Pig</string>
    <string name="pig_help_text">Roll the die as often as you like; the numbers add up in the pot. Hold to bank the pot into your score. Roll a 1 and you lose the pot and the turn. First to the goal wins. Big Pig rolls two dice (one 1 busts, two 1s score 25, doubles count twice). Hog is one roll of as many dice as you choose (any 1 scores nothing). Twenty-One Plus banks a pot of exactly 21 for you with a 10-point bonus.</string>
